  "notes": "Warm off-white #f7f7f2 canvas against charcoal #1f2933 sidebar; muted earthy data palette (olive, forest green, terracotta, mauve, taupe) rather than saturated brand colour. Sections separated by hairline rules, not cards. Signed amounts use typographic minus and colour (olive positive, terracotta negative); internal transfers rendered with grey row tint and strikethrough amounts so they don't count. Monthly bar chart columns are full buttons; selected month gets a pale band and teal underline, and drives KPIs, donuts and list. Category legend rows filter the list and add a '清除分類' clear link. Row click opens a right-side detail drawer with scrim (verified live). Header eye-slash button hides amounts (privacy mode). Disclaimer footer in tiny grey text."
